<p dir=3D"auto">The <strong>scope chain</strong> is the mechanism JavaScrip=
t uses to resolve variable references by searching through nested scopes fr=
om innermost to outermost until the variable is found (or a <code>Reference=
Error</code> is thrown).</p>
