<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Note:</strong></p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>The chain is created at <strong>function definition time</strong> (lexi=
cal scoping), not at call time</li>
<li>It only goes <strong>outward</strong> =E2=80=94 outer scopes cannot acc=
ess inner variables</li>
<li>Closures work because inner functions retain a reference to their outer=
 scope chain</li>
</ul>
