<p dir=3D"auto">Type coercion is the automatic or implicit conversion of va=
lues from one data type to another (such as strings to numbers). Type conve=
rsion is similar to type coercion because they both convert values from one=
 data type to another with one key difference =E2=80=94 type coercion is im=
plicit whereas type conversion can be either implicit or explicit.</p>
