<p dir=3D"auto">Logical assignment operators (ES2021) combine a logical ope=
rator with assignment. There are three:</p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Operator</th>
<th>Equivalent to</th>
<th>Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>&amp;&amp;=3D</code></td>
<td><code>a &amp;&amp; (a =3D b)</code></td>
<td>Assigns <code>b</code> to <code>a</code> only if <code>a</code> is <str=
ong>truthy</strong></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>||=3D</code></td>
<td><code>a || (a =3D b)</code></td>
<td>Assigns <code>b</code> to <code>a</code> only if <code>a</code> is <str=
ong>falsy</strong></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>??=3D</code></td>
<td><code>a ?? (a =3D b)</code></td>
<td>Assigns <code>b</code> to <code>a</code> only if <code>a</code> is <str=
ong>null or undefined</strong></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
