ode></li>
<li>Need no return value (side effects)? =E2=86=92 <code>forEach()</code></=
li>
<li>Avoid <code>forEach()</code> when you need a result =E2=80=94 use <code=
>map()/filter()/reduce()</code> instead</li>
</ul>
