<p dir=3D"auto"><code>[]</code> and <code>new Array()</code> are two differ=
ent ways of creating an array, but they are functionally equivalent.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">The primary difference between them is in how they are crea=
ted and in their behavior when used with certain methods.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><code>[]</code> is a shorthand for creating a new array. It=
