<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Real-World Use Case:</strong></p>
<p dir=3D"auto">In a Node.js data-processing pipeline, <code>for...of</code=
> with <code>await</code> (inside an <code>async</code> function) iterates =
over a paginated API result set sequentially =E2=80=94 something <code>forE=
ach</code> cannot do since it ignores returned Promises. <code>for...in</co=
de> is used to dynamically enumerate config object keys when serializing en=
vironment-specific settings.</p>
