<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li><strong><code>break</code></strong>: Immediately terminates the <strong=
>innermost</strong> loop or <code>switch</code> statement and transfers con=
trol to the statement following it.</li>
<li><strong><code>continue</code></strong>: Skips the <strong>current itera=
tion</strong> of the innermost loop and jumps to the next iteration's condi=
tion check.</li>
</ul>
