<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Real-World Use Case:</strong></p>
<p dir=3D"auto">In a search autocomplete engine, <code>break</code> short-c=
ircuits a loop over a large dataset once the desired number of suggestions =
is collected, preventing unnecessary iterations. <code>continue</code> is u=
