code>).</li>
<li><strong>Optional chaining (<code>?.</code>)</strong>: Short-circuits an=
d returns <code>undefined</code> instead of throwing a <code>TypeError</cod=
e> when accessing a property on <code>null</code> or <code>undefined</code>=
