<p dir=3D"auto">The <code>bind()</code> method creates a new function, when=
 invoked, has the <code>this</code> sets to a provided value. The <code>bin=
d()</code> method allows an object to borrow a method from another object w=
ithout making a copy of that method. This is known as function <strong>borr=
owing</strong> in JavaScript.</p>
