<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Generator-Function:</strong></p>
<p dir=3D"auto">A generator-function is defined like a normal function, but=
 whenever it needs to generate a value, it does so with the <code>yield</co=
de> keyword rather than <code>return</code>. The <code>yield</code> stateme=
nt suspends function's execution and sends a value back to caller, but reta=
ins enough state to enable function to resume where it is left off. When re=
sumed, the function continues execution immediately after the last <code>yi=
eld</code> run.</p>
