<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Key points:</strong></p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>Callbacks can be named or anonymous functions</li>
<li>They enable <strong>asynchronous</strong> and <strong>non-blocking</str=
ong> code</li>
<li>Overusing nested callbacks leads to "<strong>callback hell</strong>" =
=E2=80=94 solved by <code>Promises</code> or <code>async/await</code></li>
</ul>
<p dir=3D"auto"><em>Note: callbacks are often used to continue code executi=
on after an asynchronous operation has completed =E2=80=94 these are called=
 asynchronous callbacks.</em>.</p>
