<p dir=3D"auto">JavaScript <strong>does not support traditional function ov=
erloading</strong> (unlike <code>Java</code> or <code>C#</code>) where mult=
iple functions can have the exact same name but different parameters. If yo=
u define two functions with the same name, the second definition will compl=
etely overwrite the first one.</p>
