<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Real-World Use Case:</strong></p>
<p dir=3D"auto">The Redux store implementation (<code>createStore</code>) u=
ses closures to encapsulate <code>currentState</code>, <code>currentReducer=
</code>, and <code>listeners</code>. External code can only interact with s=
tate through the returned <code>dispatch</code>, <code>getState</code>, and=
 <code>subscribe</code> functions =E2=80=94 a closure-based module pattern =
that enforces immutable, predictable state management at scale.</p>
