<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Real-World Use Case:</strong></p>
<p dir=3D"auto">In Single Page Applications (SPAs), route navigation causes=
 component unmounting. Event listeners or WebSocket message handlers regist=
ered on <code>mount</code> but not removed on <code>unmount</code> keep the=
 entire component closure alive for the application's lifetime, causing mem=
ory growth that crashes long-running sessions (e.g., trading dashboards, ki=
osk apps). React's <code>useEffect</code> cleanup function pattern was desi=
gned specifically to address this.</p>
