<p dir=3D"auto"><strong><code>Set</code></strong> is a collection of <stron=
g>unique values</strong> of any type. It maintains insertion order and prov=
ides O(1) <code>has()</code> lookup (hash-based internally in V8).</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong><code>Map</code></strong> is a collection of <stron=
g>key-value pairs</strong> where keys can be <strong>any type</strong> (inc=
luding objects, functions, and <code>NaN</code>). Plain objects only allow =
string/Symbol keys.</p>
