<td>String / Symbol only</td>
<td>Any value (including objects)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Ordered</td>
<td>Not guaranteed (though V8 preserves insertion order for string keys in =
practice)</td>
<td>Insertion order guaranteed by spec</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Size</td>
<td><code>Object.keys(obj).length</code> =E2=80=94 O(n)</td>
<td><code>map.size</code> =E2=80=94 O(1)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Iteration</td>
<td><code>for...in</code> (includes prototype) / <code>Object.entries()</co=
de></td>
<td><code>for...of</code>, <code>forEach</code>, direct iterators</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Prototype pollution</td>
<td>Possible (e.g., <code>__proto__</code>)</td>
<td>Not possible</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>JSON serialisable</td>
<td>Yes</td>
<td>(needs custom serialiser)</td>
</tr>
