lue meaning "no object here", while <code>undefined</code> means "value not=
 provided".</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">Default expressions are evaluated <strong>lazily</strong> =
=E2=80=94 they run each time the function is called with a missing argument=
, not once at function definition time. This allows defaults that reference=
 other parameters or call functions.</p>
