<td>Perform case-insensitive matching</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>g</td>
<td>Perform a global match rather than stops at first match</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>m</td>
<td>Perform multiline matching</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
