<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Real-World Use Case:</strong></p>
<p dir=3D"auto">E-commerce platforms use <code>localStorage</code> to persi=
st the shopping cart so items survive browser restarts. Multi-step checkout=
 wizards use <code>sessionStorage</code> for in-progress form data =E2=80=
=94 it is automatically discarded when the user closes the tab, preventing =
stale checkout state from appearing in future sessions. This distinction el=
iminates the need for complex server-side session cleanup logic.</p>
