clear()</code>)</li>
<li><code>oldValue</code> =E2=80=94 previous value (or <code>null</code>)</=
li>
<li><code>newValue</code> =E2=80=94 new value (or <code>null</code> on <cod=
e>removeItem</code>)</li>
<li><code>url</code> =E2=80=94 the origin URL that triggered the change</li=
>
<li><code>storageArea</code> =E2=80=94 reference to the affected storage ob=
ject</li>
</ul>
