<p dir=3D"auto">Promises are used to handle asynchronous operations. They p=
rovide an alternative approach for callbacks by reducing the callback hell =
and writing the cleaner code.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">Promises have three states:</p>
<ol dir=3D"auto">
<li><strong>pending:</strong> initial state, neither fulfilled nor rejected=
.</li>
<li><strong>fulfilled:</strong> meaning that the operation was completed su=
ccessfully.</li>
<li><strong>rejected:</strong> meaning that the operation failed.</li>
</ol>
