<p dir=3D"auto">Below are the list of pros and cons of promises over callba=
cks,</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Pros:</strong></p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>It avoids callback hell which is unreadable</li>
<li>Easy to write sequential asynchronous code with <code>.then()</code></l=
i>
<li>Easy to write parallel asynchronous code with <code>Promise.all()</code=
></li>
<li>Solves some of the common problems of callbacks(call the callback too l=
ate, too early, many times and swallow errors/exceptions)</li>
<li>Integrated error handling.</li>
<li>Additional static methods: <code>Promise.allSettled()</code>, <code>Pro=
mise.any()</code>, <code>Promise.race()</code></li>
</ul>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Cons:</strong></p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>It makes little complex code</li>
<li>It cannot return multiple arguments.</li>
</ul>
