<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>1. async Attribute</strong></p>
<p dir=3D"auto">The async attribute is used to indicate to the browser that=
 the script file can be executed asynchronously. The HTML parser does not n=
eed to pause at the point it reaches the script tag to fetch and execute, t=
he execution can happen whenever the script becomes ready after being fetch=
ed in parallel with the document parsing.</p>
