=94=82
   =E2=96=BC                      =E2=96=BC                           =E2=
=96=BC
Executes sync     setTimeout, fetch,         Queued callbacks waiting
code (LIFO)       DOM events, etc.           to enter the call stack
</code></pre><div class=3D"zeroclipboard-container">
