<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Garbage collection (GC)</strong> is the automatic p=
rocess by which JavaScript frees up memory occupied by objects that are no =
longer reachable (i.e., no references point to them).</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>1. Reference Counting algorithm (legacy)</strong></=
p>
