<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Real-World Use Case:</strong></p>
<p dir=3D"auto">Node.js HTTP server frameworks like Fastify and Express use=
 <code>process.nextTick</code> internally to defer error propagation and mi=
ddleware continuations to the next microtask checkpoint =E2=80=94 ensuring =
that all synchronous setup code in a route handler completes before the fra=
mework processes the response.</p>
