<p dir=3D"auto">Class fields (instance properties declared with <code>=3D</=
code>) are initialised in the <strong>constructor</strong> for each instanc=
e. An arrow function class field (<code>method =3D () =3D&gt; {}</code>) cr=
eates a <strong>new function object per instance</strong>, with <code>this<=
/code> permanently bound.</p>
