<p dir=3D"auto">It is recommended to avoid creating new objects using <code=
>new Object()</code>. Instead you can initialize values based on it is type=
 to create the objects.</p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>Assign {} instead of new Object()</li>
<li>Assign "" instead of new String()</li>
<li>Assign 0 instead of new Number()</li>
<li>Assign false instead of new Boolean()</li>
<li>Assign [] instead of new Array()</li>
<li>Assign /()/ instead of new RegExp()</li>
<li>Assign function (){} instead of new Function()</li>
</ul>
