<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>2. Deep Copy:</strong></p>
<p dir=3D"auto">A deep copy copies all fields, and makes copies of dynamica=
lly allocated memory pointed to by the fields. A deep copy occurs when an o=
bject is copied along with the objects to which it refers.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">A Deep copy of the object can be done using <code>JSON.pars=
e(JSON.stringify(object))</code></p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Example:</strong></p>
