<p dir=3D"auto">Reflection is defined as the ability of a program to inspec=
t and modify its structure and behavior at runtime. <code>Reflect</code> is=
 not a function object. <code>Reflect</code> helps with forwarding default =
operations from the handler to the target.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><code>Reflect</code> methods are designed to be used inside=
 <code>Proxy</code> handlers to forward the default behaviour after custom =
logic.</p>
