<p dir=3D"auto">Below are the list of benefits of Getters and Setters,</p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>They provide simpler syntax</li>
<li>They are used for defining computed properties, or accessors in JS.</li=
>
<li>Useful to provide equivalence relation between properties and methods</=
li>
<li>They can provide better data quality</li>
<li>Useful for doing things behind the scenes with the encapsulated logic.<=
/li>
</ul>
