<tr>
<th>Set</th>
<th>WeakSet</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Can contain any type of values</td>
<td>Can only contain objects</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>To find number of elements use <code>.size()</code></td>
<td>To find elements count use <code>.length()</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>.forEach() is available to iterate</td>
<td>No .forEach() to iterate</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Nothing is auto destroyed</td>
<td>If an element object has no other reference left, it will be auto relea=
sed to garbage collector</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
