<p dir=3D"auto">An <strong>async iterator</strong> is an object that implem=
ents the async iteration protocol: its <code>Symbol.asyncIterator</code> me=
thod returns an object with a <code>next()</code> method that returns a <st=
rong>Promise</strong> resolving to <code>{ value, done }</code>. The <code>=
for await...of</code> loop consumes async iterables, making it easy to proc=
ess streams, paginated APIs, or any async sequence.</p>
