<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Key differences from regular iterators:</strong></p=
>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th></th>
<th>Synchronous Iterator</th>
<th>Async Iterator</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Protocol</td>
<td><code>Symbol.iterator</code></td>
<td><code>Symbol.asyncIterator</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>next()</code> returns</td>
<td><code>{ value, done }</code></td>
<td><code>Promise&lt;{ value, done }&gt;</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Loop</td>
<td><code>for...of</code></td>
<td><code>for await...of</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Use case</td>
<td>Arrays, strings, Maps</td>
<td>Streams, paginated APIs</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
