<p dir=3D"auto">Dynamic <code>import()</code> (ES2020) allows you to import=
 a module <strong>on demand</strong> at runtime rather than statically at t=
he top of a file. It returns a <strong>Promise</strong> that resolves to th=
e module object, enabling lazy loading and code splitting.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Syntax:</strong></p>
