<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>1. Window Object</strong>:</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">The window object is the topmost object of the DOM hierarch=
y. It represents a browser window or frame that displays the contents of th=
e webpage. Whenever a window appears on the screen to display the contents =
of the document, the window object is created.</p>
