<p dir=3D"auto">The <code>window.history</code> object allows you to access=
 the history stack of the browser. To navigate to a URL in the history, you=
 use the <code>back()</code>, <code>forward()</code>, and <code>go()</code>=
 methods. The <code>history.length</code> returns the number of URLs in the=
 history stack.</p>
