<p dir=3D"auto">The Browser Object Model (BOM) allows JavaScript to "talk t=
o" the browser. It consists of the objects navigator, history, screen, loca=
tion and document which are children of window. The Browser Object Model is=
 not standardized and can change based on different browsers.</p>
