auth tokens per tab.</li>
<li><code>Cookies</code> =E2=80=94 authentication tokens sent with every re=
quest, CSRF tokens, tracking (can be made <code>HttpOnly</code> for securit=
y).</li>
<li><code>IndexedDB</code> =E2=80=94 large structured datasets, offline app=
s, file/blob storage.</li>
</ul>
