<p dir=3D"auto">The <strong>Intersection Observer API</strong> provides a w=
ay to asynchronously observe changes in the intersection of a target elemen=
t with an ancestor element or the viewport. It is commonly used for lazy lo=
ading images, infinite scrolling, and triggering animations when elements c=
ome into view =E2=80=94 all without scroll event listeners that can hurt pe=
rformance.</p>
