<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>When appropriate:</strong> database connection pool=
s, configuration registries, application-wide event buses, loggers, feature=
 flag services =E2=80=94 resources that are expensive to initialise or must=
 be shared state.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>When it is an anti-pattern:</strong> when the singl=
eton makes code hard to test (tight coupling), when it hides dependencies (=
dependency injection is preferable), or when it holds mutable global state =
that causes subtle bugs in concurrent/multi-tenant environments.</p>
