<p dir=3D"auto">The <strong>Builder pattern</strong> separates the construc=
tion of a complex object from its representation, allowing the same constru=
ction process to produce different representations. It solves the <em>teles=
coping constructor</em> problem =E2=80=94 constructors with many optional p=
arameters.</p>
