<p dir=3D"auto">The <strong>Mediator pattern</strong> defines an object tha=
t encapsulates how a set of objects interact. Instead of components communi=
cating directly (creating a tightly coupled mesh), they communicate only th=
rough the mediator, reducing dependencies from O(n=C2=B2) to O(n).</p>
