<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>MVC (Model-View-Controller):</strong></p>
<p dir=3D"auto">MVC separates an application into three components:</p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li><strong>Model</strong> =E2=80=94 manages data and business logic</li>
<li><strong>View</strong> =E2=80=94 renders the UI based on model data</li>
<li><strong>Controller</strong> =E2=80=94 handles user input, updates model=
 and view</li>
</ul>
