<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>DRY</strong> stands for <strong>Don't Repeat Yourse=
lf</strong>. It states that every piece of knowledge must have a single, un=
ambiguous, authoritative representation within a system. Duplicated logic m=
akes code harder to maintain because changes must be applied in multiple pl=
aces.</p>
