<p dir=3D"auto">The <strong>12-Factor App</strong> is a methodology for bui=
lding modern, scalable, maintainable software-as-a-service applications. It=
 was created by Heroku engineers and applies equally to Node.js/JavaScript =
back-end services.</p>
