<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Content Security Policy (CSP)</strong> is an HTTP r=
esponse header that lets servers declare which dynamic resources (scripts, =
styles, fonts, images, etc.) are allowed to load. It is the primary defense=
 against <strong>XSS</strong> and <strong>data injection attacks</strong>.<=
/p>
