<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Key directives:</strong></p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Directive</th>
<th>Purpose</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>default-src</code></td>
<td>Fallback for all resource types</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>script-src</code></td>
<td>Allowed JavaScript sources</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>style-src</code></td>
<td>Allowed CSS sources</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>img-src</code></td>
<td>Allowed image sources</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>connect-src</code></td>
<td>Allowed <code>fetch</code>, <code>XHR</code>, <code>WebSocket</code> en=
dpoints</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>frame-ancestors</code></td>
<td>Controls iframe embedding (replaces <code>X-Frame-Options</code>)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>report-uri</code> / <code>report-to</code></td>
<td>URL for violation reports</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Common values:</strong></p>
