<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Background Sync</strong> is a Progressive Web App (=
PWA) capability that lets web applications defer network tasks when a devic=
e is offline so they can automatically execute as soon as a stable internet=
 connection returns. For example, if a user submits a form while offline, t=
he sync can be retried automatically when connectivity is restored =E2=80=
=94 even if the app is no longer open.</p>
