<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Push Notifications</strong> allow a server to send =
messages to a user's device even when the PWA is not open in the browser, u=
sing the <strong>Push API</strong> and <strong>Notifications API</strong> t=
ogether.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Flow:</strong></p>
<ol dir=3D"auto">
<li>App requests notification permission from the user.</li>
<li>App subscribes to the browser's push service (generates a unique subscr=
iption endpoint).</li>
<li>Subscription is sent to the app's server.</li>
<li>Server sends a push message to the endpoint via the Web Push Protocol.<=
/li>
<li>Service worker receives the push event and shows a notification.</li>
</ol>
