<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Workbox</strong> is a set of open-source JavaScript=
 libraries created by Google that simplifies the process of adding offline =
support, routing, and caching to Progressive Web Apps (PWAs).</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">Instead of writing complex, error-prone boilerplate code to=
 manage a Service Worker from scratch, Workbox provides ready-made tools to=
 automate these tasks.</p>
