<p dir=3D"auto">Rate limiting is a core infrastructure concern for APIs, pr=
eventing abuse, protecting downstream services, and enforcing fair-use poli=
cies. There are several algorithms; the two most practical are the <strong>=
Sliding Window</strong> counters, and the <strong>Token Bucket</strong> (sm=
ooth bursting).</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Option 1: Sliding Window Log (Most Accurate)</stron=
g></p>
